-- 유저가 상점에서 구매해 보유 중인 치장 아이템 목록을 관리한다(런타임 캐시 + 서버 권위 + 구매 처리).
@Logic
script ShopItemManager extends Logic

	property boolean isShopItemOwnershipLoaded = false

	property boolean isPurchaseInProgress = false

	property string CONTENT_DOMAIN_COSTUME = "costume"
	property string CONTENT_DOMAIN_CHARACTER = "character"
	property string CONTENT_CATEGORY_IDOL = "idol"

	property table purchaseCharacterIds = {}
	property number lastRefreshRequestedAt = -5

	-- ownedShopItemIds: { shopItemId:string, shopItemId:string, ... }
	property any ownedShopItemIds = {}

	-- ownedShopItemIdSet: { [shopItemId:string] = true }
	property any ownedShopItemIdSet = {}

	property string currentUserId = ""

	property any userEnterHandler = nil

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void OnBeginPlay()
		-- 유저 입장 시점에 서버 권위 상점 소유 목록을 로드하고 클라이언트에 동기화합니다.
		self.userEnterHandler = _UserService:ConnectEvent(UserEnterEvent, self.OnUserEnter)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void OnEndPlay()
		-- 서버 종료 시점에 유저 입장 이벤트 핸들러를 정리합니다.
		if self.userEnterHandler ~= nil then
			_UserService:DisconnectEvent(UserEnterEvent, self.userEnterHandler)
			self.userEnterHandler = nil
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean ClientHasShopItem(string shopItemId)
		-- 클라이언트 로컬 캐시의 상점 아이템 보유 여부를 반환합니다.
		if shopItemId == nil or shopItemId == "" then
			return false
		end

		local tShopItem = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(shopItemId)
		if tShopItem ~= nil and (tShopItem.characterId or "") ~= "" then
			local tCharacter = _CharacterManager:ClientGetCharacterById(tShopItem.characterId)
			if tCharacter ~= nil and tCharacter.isDiscovered then return true end
		end

		return self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] == true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any ClientGetOwnedShopItemIds()
		-- 클라이언트 로컬 캐시의 보유 상점 아이템 id 목록 복사본을 반환합니다.
		return self:CopyStringList(self.ownedShopItemIds)
	end

	@ExecSpace("Server")
	method boolean RequestPurchaseItems(table shopItemIds)
		-- 클라이언트 요청으로 지정한 상점 아이템들을 한 번에 구매합니다.
		if self:CanUseShopItems(senderUserId) == false then
			return false
		end

		return self:PurchaseItemsWithCommit(shopItemIds, senderUserId)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void OnUserEnter(UserEnterEvent event)
		-- 유저가 서버에 입장하면 상점 소유 데이터를 로드하고 해당 클라이언트에 전송합니다.
		if event == nil or event.UserId == nil or event.UserId == "" then
			return
		end
		if self.currentUserId ~= nil and self.currentUserId ~= "" and self.currentUserId ~= event.UserId then
			log_warning("[ERROR][ShopItemManager] single-user instance violation currentUserId=" .. tostring(self.currentUserId)
				.. " enteredUserId=" .. tostring(event.UserId))
			return
		end

		self.currentUserId = event.UserId
		self:LoadShopItems()

		if self:IsShopItemsLoaded() then
			self:PushShopItemsToClient(event.UserId)
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void LoadShopItems()
		-- Storage에서 보유 상점 아이템 id 목록을 읽어 서버 권위 캐시로 보관합니다.
		if self.currentUserId == nil or self.currentUserId == "" then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] currentUserId is required")
			self.isShopItemOwnershipLoaded = false
			return
		end

		local loadedShopItemIds = {}
		if _ShopItemStorage ~= nil then
			loadedShopItemIds = _ShopItemStorage:LoadShopItems(self.currentUserId)
			if loadedShopItemIds == nil then
				log_warning("[ShopItemManager] shop item ids are nil")
				self.isShopItemOwnershipLoaded = false
				return
			end
		end

		self:RegisterOwnedShopItems(loadedShopItemIds)
		self.isShopItemOwnershipLoaded = true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean IsShopItemsLoaded()
		-- 서버 상점 소유 데이터 로드 여부를 반환합니다.
		return self.isShopItemOwnershipLoaded
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean CanUseShopItems(string userId)
		-- Request 입구에서 현재 유저와 상점 소유 데이터 로드 상태를 검증합니다.
		if self.isPurchaseInProgress or self:IsShopItemsLoaded() == false then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] request rejected because shop items are not loaded or a purchase is in progress")
			return false
		end

		if self.currentUserId == nil or self.currentUserId == "" then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] request rejected because currentUserId is empty")
			return false
		end

		if userId == nil or userId == "" or userId ~= self.currentUserId then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] request rejected invalid userId=" .. tostring(userId))
			return false
		end

		return _ShopItemStorage:IsShopInitializationReady(userId)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean ServerHasShopItem(string shopItemId)
		-- 서버 권위 캐시에 지정한 상점 아이템을 보유하고 있는지 반환합니다.
		if self:IsShopItemsLoaded() == false then
			return false
		end

		if shopItemId == nil or shopItemId == "" then
			return false
		end

		local tShopItem = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(shopItemId)
		if tShopItem ~= nil and (tShopItem.characterId or "") ~= "" then
			local tCharacter = _CharacterManager:ServerGetCharacterById(tShopItem.characterId)
			if tCharacter ~= nil and tCharacter.isDiscovered then return true end
		end

		return self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] == true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any ServerGetOwnedShopItemIds()
		-- 서버 권위 보유 상점 아이템 id 목록 복사본을 반환합니다.
		if self:IsShopItemsLoaded() == false then
			return {}
		end

		return self:CopyStringList(self.ownedShopItemIds)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean PurchaseItemsWithCommit(any shopItemIds, string forUserId)
		-- 재화별 저장 확인 경로로 차감 후 소유 캐시와 화면 반영
		if not self:CanUseShopItems(forUserId) or _ProgressManager == nil
			or not _ProgressManager:CanUseProgress(forUserId) then return false end
		local purchaseTargets = self:CollectPurchasableShopItemIds(shopItemIds)
		if #purchaseTargets == 0 then return false end
		local totalPrice = self:GetTotalPrice(purchaseTargets)
		if totalPrice < 0 then return false end
		local tFirst = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(purchaseTargets[1])
		local currency = self:GetCurrencyForCoinType(tFirst.coinType)
		if currency == "" then return false end
		local nextOwnedIds = self:CopyStringList(self.ownedShopItemIds)
		local characterIds = {}
		for _, id in ipairs(purchaseTargets) do
			table.insert(nextOwnedIds, id)
			local tItem = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(id)
			if (tItem.characterId or "") ~= "" then table.insert(characterIds, tItem.characterId) end
		end
		self.isPurchaseInProgress = true
		self.purchaseCharacterIds = characterIds
		local ok, confirmed = pcall(function()
			if totalPrice == 0 then
				local balance = _ProgressManager:GetCurrencyBalance(_ProgressManager.CURRENCY_MESO)
				return balance ~= nil and _ProgressManager:CommitCurrencyBalanceConfirmed(
					_ProgressManager.CURRENCY_MESO, balance, nextOwnedIds, forUserId)
			end
			if currency == _ProgressManager.CURRENCY_DIAMOND then
				if not _DiamondWalletLogic:IsInitializedForUser(forUserId)
					or not _ShopItemStorage:PrepareDiamondShopPurchase(forUserId, characterIds) then return false end
				return _DiamondWalletLogic:TryPurchaseShopItems(forUserId, totalPrice, purchaseTargets, characterIds)
			end
			return _ProgressManager:TrySpendCurrencyForShopItems(currency, totalPrice, nextOwnedIds, forUserId)
		end)
		if ok and confirmed then self:ApplyConfirmedShopGrants(purchaseTargets, characterIds, forUserId) end
		self.purchaseCharacterIds = {}
		self.isPurchaseInProgress = false
		if not _ShopItemStorage.canSaveShopItems then self.isShopItemOwnershipLoaded = false end
		if _CharacterStorage.isShopSaveDeferred and _CharacterStorage.canSaveCharacters then
			_CharacterStorage.isShopSaveDeferred = false
			_CharacterManager:SaveCharactersToStorage()
		end
		if not ok or not confirmed then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] purchase was not confirmed userId=" .. tostring(forUserId))
			return false
		end
		return true
	end
	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any CollectPurchasableShopItemIds(any shopItemIds)
		-- 요청 전체 검증으로 잘못된 상품의 부분 결제 방지
		if not _DiamondWalletStorage:IsValidGrantIds(shopItemIds) or #shopItemIds == 0 then return {} end
		local coinType = ""
		local characterSet = {}
		for _, id in ipairs(shopItemIds) do
			local tItem = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(id)
			if tItem == nil or self:ServerHasShopItem(id) then return {} end
			if coinType ~= "" and coinType ~= tItem.coinType then return {} end
			coinType = tItem.coinType
			if (tItem.characterId or "") ~= "" then
				if not _CharacterManager:CanUseCharacters(self.currentUserId) then return {} end
				local tCharacter = _CharacterManager.tCharacterById[tItem.characterId]
				if tCharacter == nil or tCharacter.isDiscovered or characterSet[tItem.characterId] then return {} end
				characterSet[tItem.characterId] = true
			end
		end
		return self:CopyStringList(shopItemIds)
	end
	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method integer GetTotalPrice(any shopItemIds)
		-- 지정한 상점 아이템 id들의 price 합계를 반환합니다.
		local total = 0
		if shopItemIds == nil or type(shopItemIds) ~= "table" or _ShopItemMaster == nil then
			return total
		end

		for _, shopItemId in ipairs(shopItemIds) do
			local tShopItem = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(shopItemId)
			if tShopItem ~= nil then
				local price = tShopItem.price or 0
				if not _ProgressManager:IsValidCurrencyAmount(price)
					or price > _ProgressManager.MAX_SAFE_CURRENCY_AMOUNT - total then return -1 end
				total = total + price
			end
		end

		return total
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void AddOwnedShopItem(string shopItemId)
		-- 유효한 상점 아이템을 서버 권위 보유 목록에 추가합니다(캐시만 변경, 저장은 호출자가 결정).
		if shopItemId == nil or shopItemId == "" then
			return
		end

		if _ShopItemMaster ~= nil and _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(shopItemId) == nil then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] purchase item not found shopItemId=" .. tostring(shopItemId))
			return
		end

		if self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] == true then
			return
		end

		table.insert(self.ownedShopItemIds, shopItemId)
		self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] = true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void SaveShopItemsToStorage()
		-- 서버 권위 상점 소유 목록을 Storage에 저장합니다.
		if _ShopItemStorage == nil then
			return
		end

		if self.currentUserId == nil or self.currentUserId == "" then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] currentUserId is required")
			return
		end

		if self:IsShopItemsLoaded() == false then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] shop items are not loaded")
			return
		end

		_ShopItemStorage:SaveShopItemsAsync(self.currentUserId, self:CopyStringList(self.ownedShopItemIds))
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void RegisterOwnedShopItems(any shopItemIds)
		-- 로드한 보유 상점 아이템 id 목록을 서버 권위 캐시에 등록합니다.
		self.ownedShopItemIds = {}
		self.ownedShopItemIdSet = {}

		if shopItemIds == nil or type(shopItemIds) ~= "table" then
			return
		end

		for _, shopItemId in ipairs(shopItemIds) do
			self:AddOwnedShopItemIdIfValid(shopItemId)
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void AddOwnedShopItemIdIfValid(string shopItemId)
		-- 중복 없이 유효한 shopItemId만 보유 목록에 추가합니다.
		if shopItemId == nil or shopItemId == "" then
			return
		end

		if _ShopItemMaster ~= nil and _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(shopItemId) == nil then
			log_warning("[ShopItemManager] ignored unknown saved shopItemId=" .. tostring(shopItemId))
			return
		end

		if self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] == true then
			return
		end

		table.insert(self.ownedShopItemIds, shopItemId)
		self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] = true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void PushShopItemsToClient(string forUserId)
		-- 서버 권위 상점 소유 목록을 지정한 클라이언트의 로컬 캐시로 전송합니다.
		if forUserId == nil or forUserId == "" then
			return
		end

		self:SyncShopItems(self:CopyStringList(self.ownedShopItemIds), forUserId)
	end

	@ExecSpace("Client")
	method void SyncShopItems(table shopItemIds)
		-- 서버에서 받은 상점 소유 목록을 클라이언트 로컬 캐시에 반영하고 UI에 변경을 알립니다.
		self:RegisterOwnedShopItemsClientOnly(shopItemIds)
		self:SendEvent(ShopItemChangedEvent())
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void RegisterOwnedShopItemsClientOnly(any shopItemIds)
		-- 클라이언트 로컬 보유 상점 아이템 캐시를 교체합니다.
		self.ownedShopItemIds = {}
		self.ownedShopItemIdSet = {}

		if shopItemIds == nil or type(shopItemIds) ~= "table" then
			return
		end

		for _, shopItemId in ipairs(shopItemIds) do
			if shopItemId ~= nil and shopItemId ~= "" and self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] ~= true then
				table.insert(self.ownedShopItemIds, shopItemId)
				self.ownedShopItemIdSet[shopItemId] = true
			end
		end
	end

	method any CopyStringList(any source)
		-- 문자열 배열 복사본을 만듭니다.
		local copied = {}
		if source == nil or type(source) ~= "table" then
			return copied
		end

		for _, value in ipairs(source) do
			if value ~= nil and value ~= "" then
				table.insert(copied, value)
			end
		end

		return copied
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method string GetCurrencyForCoinType(string coinType)
		-- 레거시 worldCoin은 플랫폼 유료 코인이 아닌 임시 재화로만 연결
		if coinType == _ShopItemMaster.COIN_TYPE_MESO then return _ProgressManager.CURRENCY_MESO end
		if coinType == _ShopItemMaster.COIN_TYPE_DIAMOND then return _ProgressManager.CURRENCY_DIAMOND end
		if coinType == _ShopItemMaster.COIN_TYPE_NIGHT_MARKET then return _ProgressManager.CURRENCY_NIGHT_MARKET_COIN end
		if coinType == _ShopItemMaster.COIN_TYPE_LEGACY_WORLD_COIN then return _ProgressManager.CURRENCY_TEMP_WORLD_COIN end
		return ""
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void ApplyConfirmedShopGrants(table itemIds, table characterIds, string userId)
		-- 저장이 확인된 보유 표식만 캐시에 합치고 신규 콘텐츠 통지
		local entries = {}
		for _, id in ipairs(itemIds) do
			self:AddOwnedShopItemIdIfValid(id)
			local tItem = _ShopItemMaster:GetShopItemById(id)
			if tItem ~= nil and (tItem.characterId or "") == "" then
				table.insert(entries, { domain = self.CONTENT_DOMAIN_COSTUME, category = tItem.category, contentId = id })
			end
		end
		for _, id in ipairs(characterIds) do
			local tCharacter = _CharacterManager.tCharacterById[id]
			if tCharacter ~= nil then
				tCharacter.isDiscovered = true
				table.insert(entries, { domain = self.CONTENT_DOMAIN_CHARACTER, category = self.CONTENT_CATEGORY_IDOL, contentId = id })
			end
		end
		self:PushShopItemsToClient(userId)
		if #characterIds > 0 then _CharacterManager:PushCharactersToClient(userId) end
		if _NewContentManager ~= nil then _NewContentManager:MarkNewContentEntries(entries, userId) end
	end

	@ExecSpace("Server")
	method void RequestPurchaseWithFeedback(table shopItemIds, string requestId)
		-- 클라이언트 요청 ID는 응답 라우팅에만 사용하고 가격·거래 ID는 서버 결정
		if senderUserId ~= self.currentUserId or type(requestId) ~= "string" or requestId == "" or #requestId > 100 then return end
		local success = self:PurchaseItemsWithCommit(shopItemIds, senderUserId)
		_ShopUILogic:ReceivePurchaseResult(requestId, success, senderUserId)
	end

	@ExecSpace("Server")
	method void RequestRefreshShop()
		-- 실패한 지급 복구 완료 후 저장소 기준으로 상점과 캐릭터 재동기화
		if senderUserId ~= self.currentUserId or self.isPurchaseInProgress
			or _ShopItemStorage.isShopItemsSaveInProgress or _CharacterStorage.isCharactersSaveInProgress then return end
		local now = _UtilLogic.ServerElapsedSeconds
		if now - self.lastRefreshRequestedAt < 5 then return end
		self.lastRefreshRequestedAt = now
		self.isPurchaseInProgress = true
		local ok, recovered = pcall(function() return _DiamondWalletLogic:LoadForUser(senderUserId) end)
		if ok and recovered then
			self:LoadShopItems()
			if not _ProgressManager:IsProgressLoaded() then
				_ProgressManager:LoadProgressFromStorage()
				_ProgressManager:PushProgressToClient(senderUserId)
			end
			if _CharacterManager.currentUserId == senderUserId and not _CharacterManager:IsCharactersLoaded() then
				_CharacterStorage.isShopSaveDeferred = false
				_CharacterManager:LoadCharacters()
				_CharacterManager:PushCharactersToClient(senderUserId)
			end
			self:PushShopItemsToClient(senderUserId)
		end
		self.isPurchaseInProgress = false
	end

end
